          "title": "You'll want to know: छाछ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "छाछ — chāch — \"buttermilk\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गर्मी में हम दोपहर को ठंडी छाछ पीते हैं। Garmī meṁ ham dopahar ko ṭhaṇḍī chāch pīte haiṁ. In summer we drink cold buttermilk at midday."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "छाछ (chāch) is a tadbhava, inherited from chācchī, \"buttermilk\", a form CDIAL reconstructs from its descendants (CDIAL 5012)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
